-code-pilot, lane code-m, direct).\n\nThe #2039 attestation design doc (`doc/2026-11-01_design_id2039.md`) cited a §8 that does not exist — its numbered sections run §1–§7 and the Phased implementation plan it meant is unnumbered. Per issue #7856's acceptance, one consistent choice applied to both references: retitle them to name the Phased implementation plan section directly.\n\n- Status line: 'implementation is phased in §8' → 'implementation is phased in the Phased implementation plan section below'\n- Prerequisites note: '(§2, §8)' → '(§2 and the Phased implementation plan section)'\n\nVerification (oracle: every § reference in the doc resolves): grep for § now shows only §4 (the #2037 investigation correction at lines 197–215; this doc also has a §4) and §2 (exists, 'During and after play'). No §8 remains. Diff is exactly 2 lines in 1 file — no protocol content, wording, phases, gates, or open decisions changed.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796806327&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8010&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8010&signature=06390dee773ed96067a91c8bba79693ebcc46b546974cf195cbdfecaf55ff977\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8010?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n